# Environment

```bash
# Optional — enables live LLM orchestration (planner → builder → critic)
# Without these, mock generation still powers the Visual Stage.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Prefer OpenAI for JSON planning; Anthropic used if set as fallback builder
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional model overrides
RADIUS_PLANNER_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
RADIUS_BUILDER_MODEL=gpt-4o
RADIUS_CRITIC_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
```
